<title>USA: Bulova Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bulova Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.38		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net		 1,747		    652</p>
<p> Revs		36,544		   32,640</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  4,599		    4,599</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.52		    $0.57</p>
<p> Net		 7,001		    2,632</p>
<p> Revs		120,792		  109,223</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  4,599		    4,599</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Bulova Corp is a unit of Loews Corp.</p>
<p>Results for full-year 1995 include after-tax gain of $363,000, or $0.08 per share, from sale of Bulova Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
